 "title": "Republic County, Kansas - Home",
 "text": "Republic County, Kansas - Home\nHome County Departments Appraiser Appeal Process Duties of Appraiser Tax Calendar FAQs Public Records Yearly Value Summary Personal Property Real Property Ag Valuation Attorney Clerk Commissioners Communications Elections Emergency Management Emergency Medical Services Health Department Highway & Road Maintenance Register of Deeds Sheriff Solid Waste Transportation Treasurer Filing a Protest Tax Information FAQs Vehicle Tag Information Weed Department Other Links Belleville City >>> City of Courtland >>> Belleville Public Library >>> USD 109 >>> Economic Development >>> Republic Co. Museum >>> Senior Resources >>> River Valley Extension >>> Republic County Hospital >>> How Do I ... Appraiser Attorney Clerk Commissioners Communications Elections Emergency Management Emergency Medical Services Health Department Highway Department Maintenance Register of Deeds Sheriff Solid Waste Transportation Treasurer Weed Department Parcel Search Tax Search Republic County GIS Neighborhood Revitilization Plan Neighborhood Revitalization Application Vehicle Property Tax Estimates Calendar Cell Phone Registry Advance Voting Application Register to Vote\nHome\nCounty Departments Appraiser Appeal Process\nDuties of Appraiser\nTax Calendar\nFAQs\nPublic Records\nYearly Value Summary\nPersonal Property\nReal Property\nAg Valuation\nAttorney\nClerk\nCommissioners\nCommunications\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEmergency Medical Services\nHealth Department\nHighway & Road\nMaintenance\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nSolid Waste\nTransportation\nTreasurer Filing a Protest\nTax Information\nFAQs\nVehicle Tag Information\nWeed Department\nOther Links Belleville City >>>\nCity of Courtland >>>\nBelleville Public Library >>>\nUSD 109 >>>\nEconomic Development >>>\nRepublic Co. Museum >>>\nSenior Resources >>>\nRiver Valley Extension >>>\nRepublic County Hospital >>>\nHow Do I ...\n. . . For the County Transportation bus call 785-527-2235 . . . For Property Fraud Alert signup, see the Register of Deeds page . . .\nAppraiser\nAttorney\nClerk\nCommissioners\nCommunications\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEmergency Medical Services\nHealth Department\nHighway Department\nMaintenance\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nSolid Waste\nTransportation\nTreasurer\nWeed Department\nHome\nAmerican Rescue Plan Act (ARPA) Application Deadline\nRepublic County Commissioners will be reviewing applications for ARPA funded grants this April. Applications for funding must be submitted by Thursday, April 21, 2022.\nApplications will be reviewed on Monday, April 25, 2022.\nApplications and Guidelines can be obtained by contacting Laura Leite, ARPA Consultant, at This email address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it. or by calling 785-577-8660.\nEOE\n-->\nSCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT\nPlease complete this Vaccine Consent Form and bring with you to your vaccination appointment.\nCOVID VACCINE CONSENT FORM\n-->\nRepublic County, Kansas\nLocated in north central Kansas, and bordering Nebraska, Republic County is home to 4,700 Kansans. In 1860, Republic County was established by the Kansas legislature and named for the Republican River, which flows south through the county. Belleville is the largest city and county seat.\nEarly settlers were well protected within the county by the opening of the military road along the California Trail through the county in 1857, which increased military vigilance. In 1866 the county seat was located in Belleville. The building of the Pawnee Indian Museum near Republic to preserve the site of the Pawnee Indian Republic was a major event.\nRESULTS OF THE APPRAISER'S MARKET STUDY ANALYSIS FOR 2026\nNOTICE OF SALE OF TOWER EQUIPMENT BY SEALED BID\n-->\nPUBLIC SAFETY BUILDING INFORMATION\n-->\nHIGH BANKS WIND PROJECT INFORMATION\nRepublic County\n1815 M Street\nBelleville , KS 66935\n7:30 am - 4:30 pm\nMonday - Friday\nAccess via east or west entrances.\nParcel Search\nTax Search\nRepublic County GIS\nNeighborhood Revitilization Plan\nNeighborhood Revitalization Application\nVehicle Property Tax Estimates\nCalendar\nCell Phone Registry\nAdvance Voting Application\nRegister to Vote\n© Copyright 2019 • Republic County, Kansas | Powered by Computer Information Concepts, Inc. | Designed by Wiley Design\nPrivacy Policy | Terms of Use",
